        <p>STOCK.TON HEATH. Nightsoil Terms.—The Town Clerk of War- rington has reported to the Sanitary Works Cpmnitttee of the Town Council that. the Run- corn Rural District Council have accepted the terms upon which the Corporation would now be prepared to treat nightsoil collected at Stockton; Heath, viz. :—A minimum of 10 loads per week at Is. 6d. per load.</p>
