        <p>WOOLSTON. Secial.—A social on behalf of the War Relief Sewing Party was held in Woolston Schools on Tuesday evening. Songs were sung by Miss Roscoe and Miss Howard, and Miss Lottie Gorton played a selection on the organ. Dancing alto took place, the M.C. being Mr. H. Stafford, and Mr. Wainwright gratuitously gave his services as pianist. Refreshments were provided, and the proceeds realised £3 14s. 64. THE LATCHFORD CADET CORPS. Headquarters, Enville-street. ORDERS. By J. B. Starkey, Officer Commanding, week ending April 28th, 1916. Parades. Tuesday.—Fall-in at Headquarters at 7.30 prompt. Physical and Company Drill. - Officer in charge, Sergt.-Major Cartwright. Signalling Section to parade under orders of Corporal F. Nelson. Friday (Uniform).—Fall in as above. In- struction, 'according to officer's appointment. Officer in charge, Lieut. W. Kitchen. Orderlies of week.—Corporal W. Rigby and Lance-Corporal N. Garlick. By Order, J. B. STARKEY, C.O. •Warrington Market Prices. At Wedneeday's Warrington Market the price of wheat ruled at 7s. 1014. to fis. per 701 b.. and 4s. 7d. to 4s. 9d. was realised for oats. • Flour realised 475. to 51s. per 2801 b., is. 114. to 2s. 2d. being the price cf thirds: The 'pries :0f bran and oth, • aids wails. 6d. to Is. 10d.</p>
        <p>WHAT IS LIFE? " Life is not to live," says a great Latin writer, "but to be well." What a difference! It isn't life when you drag on from day to day, feeling "fit for nothing," "played out," and "broken down" in health; when you can't eat, can't sleep, can't work, and all because your stomach and liver are out of order, and your food is not being digested, and therefore is not nourishing you properly. No! That isn't life ! It's just a wretched existence! But, of course, you want to be well! Then try what Mother Seigel's Syrup can do for You! It has brought tens of thousands of , people out of ill-health and misery. It has banished their indigestion, toned up their stomachs and stimulated their livers and bowels to healthful working order. As a stomach. and liver tonic, its equal would be hard to find.</p>
